# Announcement Manager Feature

## File locations
- Backend model/API: `superset/announcements/`
- Frontend components: `superset-frontend/src/features/announcements/`

## Backend rules
- Extend `BaseSupersetModelRestApi` for the REST API
- Use Marshmallow schemas for validation
- Add `can_read` permission to Public role (banner shows for all users)
- Add `can_write/delete` to Admin role only
- Follow model pattern from `superset/charts/api.py`

## Frontend rules  
- Use `useTheme()` from `@superset-ui/core` for all colors — no hardcoded hex values
- Fetch announcements from `/api/v1/announcement/?status=active`
- Store dismissed banner IDs in localStorage under key `superset_dismissed_announcements`
- The AnnouncementBanner component must render on every route — wire it into the app shell
- Severity order for banner priority: critical → warning → info → success